entries[120023] = { ["name"] = "Primal Aspirant's Leather Tunic", ["text"] = "Warlords Season 1\nBinds when picked up\nChest Leather\n8 Armor\n+5 [Agility or Intellect]\n+7 Stamina\n+ 5 Critical Strike\n+ 5 Mastery\nDurability 140 / 140\nClasses: Rogue\nRequires any Horde race\nGladiator's Vestments (0/5)\nGladiator's Leather Tunic\nGladiator's Leather Helm\nGladiator's Leather Gloves\nGladiator's Leather Spaulders\nGladiator's Leather Legguards\nLegacy Set: Bonus is inactive\n(2) Set Assassination: Successfully interrupting a spell with Kick generates 3 combo points. (2) Set Outlaw: Successfully interrupting a spell with Kick generates 3 combo points. (2) Set Subtlety: Successfully interrupting a spell with Kick generates 3 combo points.\n(4) Set Assassination: When you use Vanish, you gain 5 Combo Points and the critical strike chance of your next Mutilate or Envenom is increased by 10%.\n(4) Set Outlaw: When you use Vanish, you gain 5 Combo Points and the critical strike chance of your next Saber Slash, Run Through, Between the Eyes, or Ambush is increased by 100%.\n(4) Set Subtlety: Feint also increases your Versatility by 140 for 5 sec.\nSell Price:" }
