entries[120137] = { ["name"] = "Tome of Polymorph: Polar Bear Cub", ["text"] = "Classes: Mage\nUse: Teaches Polymorph: Polar Bear Cub.\nTransforms the enemy into a polar bear cub, wandering around incapacitated for 1 min. While affected, the victim cannot take actions but will regenerate health very quickly. Damage will cancel the effect. Limit 1.\n\nOnly works on Beasts, Humanoids and Critters. [ Glyph of Crittermorph : When critters are affected, can affect multiple targets, and has a duration of 1 day ]\nSell Price:" }
